{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526348",
      "title": "Fetching User Input",
      "lectureOrder": 137,
      "videoOrder": 119,
      "sourceHash": "a25710d6b368328789312753ed2fd36b30d2cfb7a9ff7f3e69f35312d9078609",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.38,
          "end": 4.7,
          "en": "So, where are you successful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.7,
          "end": 6.153,
          "en": "Let's implement it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 11.64,
          "en": "And for that I'll first of all add my script section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.64,
          "end": 14.1,
          "en": "and we definitely need a method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 15.8,
          "en": "a method which should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.8,
          "end": 17.6,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.6,
          "end": 19.28,
          "en": "I'll name it submitData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.28,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "but you can of course use any method name you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 26.27,
          "en": "Here, I now want to get the values entered into this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.27,
          "end": 28.71,
          "en": "this text area, and this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.71,
          "end": 32.06,
          "en": "And we've got two main ways of collecting this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.06,
          "end": 36.38,
          "en": "Option one is that we use some data properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.38,
          "end": 40.26,
          "en": "and then we use V-Model or an input listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.26,
          "end": 42.2,
          "en": "to update it with every keystroke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.2,
          "end": 45.97,
          "en": "So to collect the free values in free data properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.97,
          "end": 49.883,
          "en": "and update each data properties value with every keystroke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 53.65,
          "en": "That would work and there is nothing wrong with it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.65,
          "end": 56.38,
          "en": "but I will use the good old refs again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.38,
          "end": 59.75,
          "en": "And for that here, I'll add a ref key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.75,
          "end": 64,
          "en": "a ref property or attribute on this first input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64,
          "end": 66.08,
          "en": "and named as titleInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.08,
          "end": 69.41,
          "en": "You know that these ref identifiers are up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.41,
          "end": 72.16,
          "en": "but of course you want to pick a name that describes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.16,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "which elements you are pointing at.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 77.673,
          "en": "Here I'll add a ref which will be to descInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.4,
          "end": 81.53,
          "en": "for description input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.53,
          "end": 82.81,
          "en": "And on the last input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.81,
          "end": 85.997,
          "en": "I'll add a ref with an identifier off linkInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.05,
          "end": 90.66,
          "en": "So now we've got these free refs registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.66,
          "end": 92.2,
          "en": "and we can now use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.2,
          "end": 94.92,
          "en": "We can now use them here in submit data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.92,
          "end": 97.66,
          "en": "to get the enter title by referring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.66,
          "end": 100.6,
          "en": "to this dollar sign refs titleInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.03999999999999,
          "end": 104.96000000000001,
          "en": "which is the ref I did use here, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.3,
          "en": "TitleInput, that's the ref I used on this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 112.24000000000001,
          "en": "And then this points at the input HTML element object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.24000000000001,
          "end": 113.72,
          "en": "which has a value prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.72,
          "end": 116.19,
          "en": "which holds what the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.19,
          "end": 119.87,
          "en": "And I'm going to repeat that for the entered description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.87,
          "end": 123.99,
          "en": "referring to the descInput value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.99,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "And for the entered url referring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 131.383,
          "en": "to this dollar sign refs urlInput.value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.83,
          "end": 136.84,
          "en": "Sorry, that was linkInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.84,
          "end": 139.823,
          "en": "so it should be linkInput.value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.3,
          "end": 144.23,
          "en": "So now these are the free values the user entered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.23,
          "end": 146.31,
          "en": "and of course they may be empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.31,
          "end": 149.81,
          "en": "We'll take care about that in a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.81,
          "end": 152.36,
          "en": "for the moment I'll assume they're not empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.36,
          "end": 154.64,
          "en": "and if they are not empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.64,
          "end": 156.96,
          "en": "then I want to ensure that they get added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.96,
          "end": 158.71,
          "en": "to all our resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.71,
          "end": 160.003,
          "en": "So how could we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 164.47,
          "en": "We could of course emit a custom event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.47,
          "end": 166.79,
          "en": "and then listen to it in the parent component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.79,
          "end": 169.11,
          "en": "of this addResource component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.11,
          "end": 173.48,
          "en": "But since we add this addResource component dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.48,
          "end": 178.28,
          "en": "like this, that will not be super easy to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.28,
          "end": 180.07,
          "en": "Of course, we don't have to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.07,
          "end": 181.96,
          "en": "this dynamic components here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.96,
          "end": 185.2,
          "en": "We could use VF to switch between two components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.2,
          "end": 187.35,
          "en": "and then we could use custom events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.35,
          "end": 190.67,
          "en": "But again, I want to practice provide and inject here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.67,
          "end": 192.34,
          "en": "So therefore I'll stick to provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.34,
          "end": 195.373,
          "en": "and inject and I'll implement it differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.51,
          "end": 202.51,
          "en": "I'll start in TheResources.vue by adding a new method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.77,
          "end": 204.923,
          "en": "the addResource method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.85,
          "end": 207.68,
          "en": "Here, I want to get the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.68,
          "end": 210.57999999999998,
          "en": "the description, and the url,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.57999999999998,
          "end": 212.97,
          "en": "and I wanna generate a new resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.97,
          "end": 216.41,
          "en": "and add it to this storedResources array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.41,
          "end": 218.34300000000002,
          "en": "whenever this method is triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.32,
          "end": 224.18,
          "en": "So in here, I'll create a newResource JavaScript object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.18,
          "end": 226.97,
          "en": "and that object needs a unique ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.97,
          "end": 229.62,
          "en": "For that I'll just create a timestamp here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.62,
          "end": 231.78,
          "en": "by instantiating the date object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.78,
          "end": 234.02,
          "en": "and I'll then get a string timestamp",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.02,
          "end": 235.743,
          "en": "by calling toISOString.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.62,
          "end": 239.023,
          "en": "That is unique enough for this purpose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.96,
          "end": 243.17,
          "en": "Then we need to set a title property in this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.17,
          "end": 247.27,
          "en": "because all our storage resources have a title property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.27,
          "end": 250.29,
          "en": "and they also have description and link properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.29,
          "end": 252.26,
          "en": "So we'll need to set those two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.26,
          "end": 254.95,
          "en": "and of course, stored values we're receiving",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.95,
          "end": 257.66,
          "en": "as arguments in those properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.66,
          "end": 260.64,
          "en": "So add description and set this equal to description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.64,
          "end": 263.123,
          "en": "and add link and set this equal to url.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 265.63,
          "end": 267.4,
          "en": "So this now is a new resource,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.4,
          "end": 270.73,
          "en": "which now can be added to the storedResources",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.73,
          "end": 272.64,
          "en": "by simply pushing it there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.64,
          "end": 276.023,
          "en": "or if we want to add it at the top by unshifting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.14,
          "end": 279,
          "en": "which is basically like push,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 279,
          "end": 280.97,
          "en": "but at the beginning of the array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.97,
          "end": 283.947,
          "en": "So here I'll unshift the newResource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.87,
          "end": 288.45,
          "en": "And I will then also set this selectedTab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 288.45,
          "end": 292,
          "en": "to storedResources so that we switched to tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 292,
          "end": 294.023,
          "en": "when we added a new resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 296.19,
          "end": 298.75,
          "en": "Now with that back in addResource,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 298.75,
          "end": 302.43,
          "en": "I want to make sure that from inside submitData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.43,
          "end": 304.73,
          "en": "I can call the addResource method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.73,
          "end": 308.19,
          "en": "we just add it to TheResources.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 308.19,
          "end": 310.09,
          "en": "How can we make this work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.09,
          "end": 312.92,
          "en": "Well, we can provide this method as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 312.92,
          "end": 314.67,
          "en": "So here in provide,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 314.67,
          "end": 317.32,
          "en": "I can add a addResource key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 317.32,
          "end": 319.37,
          "en": "This key name is up to you though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 319.37,
          "end": 321.77,
          "en": "but I want to point at this ad resource,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 321.77,
          "end": 323.513,
          "en": "hence I'm pointing at my method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.76,
          "end": 326.25,
          "en": "I'm not executing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 326.25,
          "end": 328.09,
          "en": "I'm just pointing at it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 328.09,
          "end": 331.14,
          "en": "And now we can inject this addResource key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 331.14,
          "end": 333.83,
          "en": "entity addResources component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 333.83,
          "end": 335.97,
          "en": "Here we can add the inject key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.90999999999997,
          "end": 339.94,
          "en": "and inject addResource like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 339.94,
          "end": 341.72,
          "en": "and this allows us to call it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.72,
          "end": 343.39,
          "en": "instead of submitData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 343.39,
          "end": 345.94,
          "en": "Here, we can now call addResource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 345.94,
          "end": 348.51,
          "en": "and forward the enteredTitle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 348.51,
          "end": 351.593,
          "en": "the enteredDescription, and the enteredUrl.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 353.93,
          "end": 355.29,
          "en": "We can save that all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 355.29,
          "end": 357.55,
          "en": "And now if we go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 357.55,
          "end": 360.243,
          "en": "and I enter some test data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 361.54,
          "end": 363.61,
          "en": "something like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 363.61,
          "end": 365.313,
          "en": "if I click Add rRsource,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 367.12,
          "end": 369.1,
          "en": "well, I forgot one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 369.1,
          "end": 372.28,
          "en": "Obviously it's nice to have to submitData method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 372.28,
          "end": 375.28,
          "en": "but I also need to trigger it when the form gets submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 375.28,
          "end": 377.45,
          "en": "and currently that's not happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 377.45,
          "end": 379.01,
          "en": "So on the form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 379.01,
          "end": 381.24,
          "en": "I want to add a submit listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 381.24,
          "end": 383.46,
          "en": "and all to prevent the browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 383.46,
          "end": 385.6,
          "en": "with the prevent modifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 385.6,
          "end": 388.02,
          "en": "And then point at submitData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 388.02,
          "end": 390.86,
          "en": "so add this method we've been working on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 390.86,
          "end": 392.08,
          "en": "And now with data added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 392.08,
          "end": 394.403,
          "en": "which of course is a quite important step,",
          "zh": ""
